WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:01.340
You press Enter.

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.088
Claude Code packs
your message, the chat

00:00:04.142 --> 00:00:06.899
so far, CLAUDE.md
and its tools.

00:00:07.719 --> 00:00:08.939
The model, in the cloud,

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:10.670
answers with tool calls.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.360
Each call passes a
permission check,

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.049
then runs on your machine.

00:00:15.829 --> 00:00:16.879
Results go back.

00:00:17.129 --> 00:00:19.638
It loops: test,
edit, test again.

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:21.489
The test passes.

00:00:21.779 --> 00:00:23.758
No more calls: you
get the answer.
